This test is much different from upstream because Tormach doesn't
apply X and Y TLOs by default, i.e. in mill configurations.  See
commit bf3d4d4a.  Accordingly, the test is modified to expect zeros in
many places.

To preserve some of the test intent, Z axis offsets are added; this
change was submitted upstream at
https://github.com/LinuxCNC/linuxcnc/pull/163.

Another parallel test should be created to test Tormach's mill
configuration.
